  "details": "I have had VRChat since 2018 and have had VRChat+ since its release for the past few month now my favorites lists in the \"Social\" menu has been maxed out, I rely on my favorites due to have anxiety and not remembering people so knowing they are trust worthy people I favorite them. The favorites list currently maxes out at 450 friends among 3 groups it would be great to see either an increase in the lists or the amount you are able to add to each list. I would assume this is a common request among VRChat+ users and hope my request would be the turning point in which the extension would be added I will continue to support VRChat with all the joy and time I have spent in it.\n\nSincerely, VRChat user ThatKindOfGamer_",
